# Build-context exclusions (root context -- setup.md section 2 builds with `-f backend/Dockerfile .`)
# Keeps Windows-only, local-only and multi-GB data out of every image build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.bat
**/*.exe
backend/uploads
backend/wheels
backend/test_*.py
docker-images
ollama-docker
offline
transfer
data
.preflight.sh
.git
